    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="1de3ff67-a77e-5b4d-910d-8ee1d9cbeddd" activityNameId="ccaf3d01-df42-5fb0-abc2-7218945962a4" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Corrugated board base paper, wellenstoff, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Corrugated board base paper, wellenstoff, at plant
na;
UUID: e9e3af6d-328f-30cf-a69a-0314c538e766
This module includes the European production of wellenstoff paper in an integrated mill - including transports to paper mill, recovered paper handling, deinking, paper production, energy production on-site and internal waste water treatment. Not included is the transport of waste paper to the mill, as this is already included in the used waste paper datasets.; Geography: Average data from European producers, collected from FEFCO and checked by technical specialists
Location:  Average data from European producers, collected from FEFCO and checked by technical specialists
Technology: Average of present used technology
Time period: &lt;null&gt;
Production volume: represented European production in 2005: 8'800 kt (FEFCO report)
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: Additional air emissions estimated based on respective industrial heating modules of this study
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e9e3af6d-328f-30cf-a69a-0314c538e766.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
